
(
-----------------------------------------------------------
Creating a dictionary with the Pin operations, in order to 
assign meaningful names without prefix Pin.xxx or similar
-----------------------------------------------------------
)

CDict Pin

(
Using the "pin" single op for all things
single pin related
)

: SetOut (pin) 1 pin ;
: SetIn  (pin) 2 pin ;
: ReadDigital (pin -- value) 3 pin ;
: ReadAnalog (pin -- value) 4 pin ;
: WriteDigital (value pin -- ) 5 pin ;
: WriteAnalog  (value pin -- ) 6 pin ;

CDictEnd


